    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d255">

                <pb facs="0232" n="158" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg158"/>

                <head>Sir F. Bruce to Mr.
                        Hunter</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-05-19"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 19, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to transmit to you the
                    following documents, which have been called forth by the recent assassination of
                    President Lincoln and the attempts to take the lives of the Hon. William H.
                    Seward and Mr. F. W. Seward:</p>
                <p>1. Address from the ministers composing the Niagara annual conference of the
                    Methodist Episcopal church in Canada; forwarded by the governor general of
                    Canada.</p>
                <pb facs="0233" n="159" xml:id="pg159"/>
                <p>2 A copy of a despatch from the governor of the Bahamas, forwarding resolutions
                    of the legislative council and house of assembly of the colony, and a copy of
                    the governor’s message to the two houses.</p>
                <p>3. A letter and a minute of resolutions from the council of the borough of
                    Liverpool, England, for Mrs. Lincoln; forwarded by the mayor of Liverpool.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, your most obedient,
                    humble servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FREDERICK W. A. BRUCE.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William Hunter,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                    <p>[For enclosures see Appendix, separate volume.]</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
